// Evil Jelly workspace-local settings example.
// Copy this file to settings.jsonc for local overrides; settings.jsonc is ignored by Git.
// Precedence: CLI flag > workspace settings.jsonc > ~/.evil-jelly/settings.jsonc > default.
// Document-domain repository facts belong in .evil-jelly/doc-map.jsonc.
